Package: fajita-shutdown-trace
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: oneplus6t <https://github.com/briancappello/oneplus6t>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: Shutdown tracing for the OnePlus 6T (fajita)
 Debugging instrumentation, not part of the adaptation. Arms a warm reset so
 ramoops survives a normal reboot, and runs a watcher through shutdown that
 records systemd's stop jobs and every D-state task with its kernel stack to
 disk, kmsg and pmsg. Remove the package to get stock reboot behaviour back.
